# 基本文章編集の印刷を、デスクトップの文章編集とプロセスの文章編集で同じにする (design 11.3,
# 11.22), for tools/ui_run.py. Two copies of 基本文章編集 with 120 paragraphs (mkbig doc 120)
# are printed with the same setting, one from the desktop's text editor (open) and one from
# the text editor running as a process (pdoc, the pages handed over by DT_RQ_PRINT): Ctrl+P
# brings up the desktop's 印刷設定 over the window (the windows stand at the same place, so
# the panel does too), its shot is kept, and Enter prints. The PDF files must be the same,
# byte for byte, but for the time each says it was made (sum pdf), and the desktop says the
# same of both ("print: N sheets, ..."). Then the same with 詳細 shown (its marks printed, as
# the desktop's window prints what it shows), chosen from 表示 in the menu opened at 300,250:
# the desktop's menu the first time opens with 閉じる on the pointer's row (表示 60 below), the
# process's after it with 表示 there; 表示's own opens with 原稿 on its row, 詳細 20 below.
# The panel is the desktop's and holds it until it is answered: sync is not answered meanwhile.
# Keys: Ctrl+P 13 01, Enter 28, Ctrl+E 08 01.
docproc kernel
mkbig doc 120
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 800
move 690 490
sync 600
key 13 01
wait 2000
shot prn_k_panel
logmark
key 28
expectsince print: 
wait 1500
sync 600
sum pdf
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig doc 120
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 120
wait 800
move 690 490
wait 300
logmark
key 13 01
wait 2000
shot prn_p_panel
key 28
expectsince document: print (0)
wait 500
sync 600
sum pdf
same kernel
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
wait 500
# 詳細
mkbig doc 120
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 500
click 300 170
sync 600
click 300 250 1
wait 400
wait 400
move 330 310
wait 300
move 440 310
wait 400
move 440 330
wait 300
click 440 330
sync 600
move 690 490
sync 600
key 13 01
wait 2000
logmark
key 28
expectsince print: 
wait 1500
sync 600
sum pdf
keep detail
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig doc 120
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 120
wait 800
logmark
click 300 170
expectsince document: drew
logmark
click 300 250 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 400
move 330 250
wait 300
move 440 250
wait 400
move 440 270
wait 300
click 440 270
expectsince document: command view.detail
expectsince document: drew
move 690 490
wait 300
logmark
key 13 01
wait 2000
key 28
expectsince document: print (0)
wait 500
sync 600
sum pdf
same detail
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
